LICENCE NOT YET FINALIZED
=========================

This repository does not yet carry a licence. Until this file is replaced by the text of
one, no rights to reuse, modify or redistribute its contents are granted beyond reading and
running the code for the purpose of peer review.

The licence is to be chosen by the authors with the agreement of the Ontario Ministry of
Natural Resources (Lake Ontario Management Unit), having regard to any Crown copyright or
government open-data requirements that apply. It must be in place before the repository is
archived with a DOI, which the Canadian Journal of Fisheries and Aquatic Sciences requires at
acceptance.

Points the choice has to take into account
------------------------------------------
These are set out, with sources, in docs/SOFTWARE_CITATIONS.md ("Licence notes"):

  * Code and data may need different licences: one for the code under salmonid/, another
    (for example CC BY 4.0 or the Open Government Licence - Ontario) for the tables under
    data/ and provenance/.

  * salmonid/detect/track_from_store.py imports BoxMOT, which is licensed AGPL-3.0. BoxMOT is
    not redistributed here, but the licence chosen for this repository should be checked for
    compatibility with importing it.

  * configs/ contains configuration files from the DEIMv2 project, and docs/ contains a patch
    to DEIMv2 source code. DEIMv2 was licensed Apache-2.0 at the commit used
    (docs/DEIMV2_PIN.md); redistributing these files requires the Apache-2.0 licence text and
    notices to accompany them.

  * The trained model weights are not in this repository. They are a derivative of the DINOv3
    backbone and can be distributed only under the DINOv3 License.

  * data/paper/spatial/ contains OpenStreetMap data, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, licensed
    under the Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0.

Third-party components keep their own licences in every case.
